OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers through the day
OL,6,Fnear the coast, but elsewhere
OL,7,Fgenerally dry and bright with cloud
OL,8,Fbreaking to give some sunny spells.
OL,9,FTemperatures below average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome isolated coastal showers
OL,13,Fare possible at first, but elsewhere
OL,14,Fit will be a dry and chilly night with
OL,15,Fa ground frost and some localised fog
OL,16,Fpatches forming.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FA dry, bright and largely
OL,19,Fsunny day for most. Showery near the
OL,20,Fcoast however, and becoming breezy
OL,21,Fhere too. Cold and frosty overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
