OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FGenerally
OL,6,Fdry with sunny periods, but also a
OL,7,Fcold wind on Friday with another
OL,8,Fovernight frost. Turning cloudier and
OL,9,Fless cold from Saturday, with perhaps
OL,10,Fthe odd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
